Package: hpc-kbd
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: HPC <hpc@local>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, python3-pywayland, python3-cffi, libwayland-client0
Description: Stable on-screen keyboard for phosh (Droidian)
 Replaces phosh-osk-stub for the Vayu. Emits keys through Wayland
 input-method-unstable-v2, owns sm.puri.OSK0 on the session bus,
 Farsi (standard IRAN) + QWERTY layouts, built-in logging to
 ~/.local/state/hpc-kbd/hpc-kbd.log.
